title: Relations with Other Parties
subtitle: Talks with the other socialists and with the Kadets.
card-image: img/cards/inter_party_relationships.svg
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: inter_party_relationships_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; inter_party_relationships_timer = 3

The bloc of the Mensheviks and the SRs is the Soviet majority, and every party is calculating how long it will last.

- @partner: Talks with the [+ partner_name +]. (Relations: [+ rel_ally : relationships +])
- @lsr: Talks with the [+ third_name +]. (Relations: [+ rel_lsr : relationships +])
- @bol: Talks with the moderate Bolsheviks. (Relations: [+ rel_bol : relationships +])
- @kad: Talks with the Kadets. (Relations: [+ rel_kad : relationships +])
- @formalize: Formalize an alliance with a partner.
- @easy_discard

@partner
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {rel_ally: 8});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 1);
!}

Delegations of the two parties met in the Soviet executive. We agreed on the war, the Assembly and everything except the land.

@lsr
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {rel_lsr: 8, rel_kad: -1});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 1);
if (Q.player_party == 'sr') { RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, -2); }
if (Q.player_party == 'lsr') { RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 2, -2); }
!}

[? if player_party = 'menshevik' : Spiridonova and Kamkov are not our natural allies, but they speak for the villages and the Baltic Fleet, and they are not afraid to speak to us. ?][? if player_party = 'sr' : Spiridonova and Kamkov are inside our party, and they say that the party has forgotten the peasants. We have listened, and promised to listen again. ?][? if player_party = 'lsr' : Dan and Martov are not our natural allies, but the Menshevik Internationalists oppose the war and the coalition, as we do. They listened. ?]

@bol
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {rel_bol: 8, rel_kad: -2});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, -2);
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 4);
!}

Kamenev's wing of the Bolsheviks would rather work with the other socialists than against them. Lenin does not agree.

@kad
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: 8, rel_bol: -1});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, -3);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 4);
!}

The Kadets are the coalition's only serious bourgeois party. Milyukov listened politely.

@formalize

Formal alliances need relations of 40 for cooperation, 60 for a bloc and 75 for a coalition. Whom do you propose it to?

- @form_partner: The [+ partner_name +].
- @form_lsr: The [+ third_name +].
- @form_bol: The Bolsheviks.
- @back: Never mind.

@form_partner
on-arrival: {!
var lvl = 0;
if (Q.rel_ally >= 75 && (Q.in_coalition || Q.assembly_survives || Q.vikzhel_deal)) { lvl = 3; }
else if (Q.rel_ally >= 60) { lvl = 2; }
else if (Q.rel_ally >= 40) { lvl = 1; }
if (lvl > Q.ally_lvl) { Q.ally_lvl = lvl; Q.alliance_msg = 1; } else { Q.alliance_msg = 0; }
Q.alliance_level = lvl;
!}
go-to: formalized if alliance_msg = 1; not_formalized if alliance_msg = 0

@form_lsr
view-if: player_party = 'menshevik' or player_party = 'lsr'
on-arrival: {!
var lvl = 0;
if (Q.rel_lsr >= 75 && (Q.in_coalition || Q.assembly_survives || Q.vikzhel_deal)) { lvl = 3; }
else if (Q.rel_lsr >= 60) { lvl = 2; }
else if (Q.rel_lsr >= 40) { lvl = 1; }
if (lvl > Q.ally_lsr) { Q.ally_lsr = lvl; Q.alliance_msg = 1; } else { Q.alliance_msg = 0; }
Q.alliance_level = lvl;
!}
go-to: formalized if alliance_msg = 1; not_formalized if alliance_msg = 0

@form_bol
on-arrival: {!
var lvl = 0;
if (Q.rel_bol >= 75 && (Q.vikzhel_deal || Q.assembly_survives)) { lvl = 3; }
else if (Q.rel_bol >= 60) { lvl = 2; }
else if (Q.rel_bol >= 40) { lvl = 1; }
if (lvl > Q.ally_bol) { Q.ally_bol = lvl; Q.alliance_msg = 1; } else { Q.alliance_msg = 0; }
Q.alliance_level = lvl;
!}
go-to: formalized if alliance_msg = 1; not_formalized if alliance_msg = 0

@formalized

The talks produced an agreement: cooperation at level [+ alliance_level +] (1 = cooperation, 2 = bloc, 3 = coalition).

@not_formalized

Relations are not warm enough, or the conditions are not right, to formalize anything more than we already have.

@back
go-to: easy_discard
